    "updated_at": "2022-12-07T20:50:00Z",
    "body": "And yes, those would be difficult to test. The former requires the user to set policy saying storage is disabled, so it can't be tested by WPT. The second would basically signal that something is catastrophically wrong in the implementation. ",
